  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What can become eligible",
      "items": [
        "Only PolicyEvaluator.evaluateCache returns eligible: a regular file under ~/Library/Caches/com.apple.iconservices.store, modified 15+ minutes before scan start, link count 1, every boundary flag observed false, reclaimable bytes above zero.",
        "lsof lists files open in running apps; a file it reports open is never eligible. If the lsof listing is unavailable, every ~/Library/Caches file counts as open, so nothing is eligible that run and the page says the open-file check could not run. GeneralMacCacheOwnerCatalog only relabels known tool caches; none sits inside the eligible scope.",
        "Scan budget per root: depth 8, 25,000 entries, 10,000 findings (GeneralMacScanLimits.current)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Approval binding",
      "items": [
        "One approval covers every eligible item at once: DisplayedPlanFactory puts all candidates into a single plan (DisplayedPlanFactory.swift:11).",
        "ApprovedTrashOperationFactory.makeOperations emits MoveToTrash operations only when ApprovalValidity.evaluate returns validForReview and the plan has targets.",
        "The digest is SHA-256 over CanonicalPlanEncoder bytes, which include createdAt and expiresAt, so every rebuilt plan carries a new digest and an old approval cannot match it.",
        "At this call site ApprovalContext reuses the displayed plan's digest and targets, so the binding checks are approved hex vs plan.digest and the 15-minute expiry; file evidence is rechecked per item later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Refusals and skips",
      "items": [
        "Invalid approval, a failed rescan, or receipt history failing before the first recorded item (busy, review required, intent write) ends in a refusal: nothing is moved. A history failure after items moved reports receiptIncomplete and keeps their Trash locations.",
        "A target no longer eligible on rescan (opened, modified less than 15 minutes ago, or gone), or outside isWithinTrashScope (backstop), gets no fresh evidence and is skipped as missingFreshEvidence.",
        "Right before FileManager.trashItem the adapter re-probes the leaf (no symlinked component, same device and inode, link count 1, size, mtime). A mismatch is skippedStale; a throw is failed(nativeMoveFailed).",
        "Open state comes from the rescan's lsof snapshot; the final probe does not re-check it. A small check-to-move race remains (FoundationTrashAdapter.swift:32-33). Only ~/Library/Caches resolves as a move root; any other root is skippedStale(rootChanged) (AdaptiveTrustSession.swift:34-36, 104-110; FoundationTrashAdapter.swift:68-70).",
        "Stop between items: remaining planned items reconcile as cancelled and the run reads interrupted.",
        "Sources as of main, November 2026."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
